  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_dick_punch_bear_interaction",
  "label": "The physical interaction between the bears is mapped as a 'dick punch'.",
  "description": "The text 'dick punch' is overlaid on the image of two bears play-fighting. The mapping is based on the visual depiction of one bear's paw on the other bear's head/neck area, which is humorously and crudely interpreted as a 'dick punch'. This is an analogical mapping where the visual action (bear play-fighting) is mapped onto the textual concept (dick punch) through a vulgar pun. The mapping relies on the viewer's understanding of the crude wordplay and the anthropomorphic interpretation of animal behavior.",
